{"path":"physics/mechanics/forces/force-analysis","title":"受力分析","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>受力分析</h1>\n<h2>画力五步口诀</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>先重力，再接触（弹力→摩擦力），最后其他力（推力/电场/磁场）。</strong></p>\n<p>口诀：&quot;<strong>重力一定画，弹力看接触，摩擦看相对，其他逐条数</strong>。&quot;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>重力</strong>：作用在重心，方向竖直向下（一切物体都要画）；</li>\n<li><strong>弹力</strong>：找接触面——有接触 + 有形变（或形变趋势）才有弹力，方向<strong>垂直于接触面</strong>（绳沿绳、杆可沿可不沿、指向恢复形变的方向）；</li>\n<li><strong>摩擦力</strong>：先判断接触面&quot;粗糙 + 有相对运动（趋势）&quot;；方向<strong>沿接触面</strong>，与相对运动（趋势）方向相反；静摩擦力大小看平衡/牛顿第二定律，滑动摩擦力 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\mu N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li><strong>其他力</strong>：推力、拉力、电场力 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">qE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">qE</span></span></span></span>、洛伦兹力 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">qvB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span>（若涉及）逐条数，<strong>别漏也不别多</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>复查</strong>：只画物体<strong>受到的</strong>力，不画它施给别人的力；每对&quot;作用力反作用力&quot;分别出现在谁的身上。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>弹力判断的&quot;移除法&quot;</h2>\n<p>假想把支撑物抽掉：若物体运动状态会变化 → 有弹力；若无影响 → 无弹力。</p>\n<h2>摩擦力方向的&quot;三步判断&quot;</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>确定<strong>相对运动方向（趋势）</strong>（假设接触面光滑，物体往哪动）；</li>\n<li>摩擦力<strong>阻碍</strong>它 → 方向与相对运动（趋势）相反；</li>\n<li>静摩擦力方向与<strong>运动方向无关</strong>（可以同向、反向、垂直——如传送带上的物体）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>整体法与隔离法（选讲，详见平衡专题）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>整体法</strong>：系统内部作用力不计，只画外力——系统加速度相同或均静止时优先；</li>\n<li><strong>隔离法</strong>：对象内部就分析内力；</li>\n<li>原则：&quot;<strong>先整体求（系统外）未知，再隔离求（系统内）内力</strong>&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>常见模型速记</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>受力要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>斜面上物体</td>\n<td>重力、支持力（垂直斜面）、摩擦力（沿斜面）；重力沿斜面分力 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竖直墙+斜面夹球</td>\n<td>重力、墙弹力（水平）、斜面支持力（垂直斜面）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻绳</td>\n<td>拉力沿绳、同一根绳（光滑处）张力处处相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻杆</td>\n<td>拉力/推力沿杆轴线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹簧</td>\n<td>弹力 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=kx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>，方向沿弹簧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"img/physics/incline-force.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>易错点</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>把&quot;牛顿第三定律的相互作用力&quot;误当平衡力（分别作用在两个物体上，谈不上平衡）；</li>\n<li>分析连接体时重复画绳子的力（内力不出现在整体法受力图里）；</li>\n<li>光滑接触面（无摩擦、无粗糙）也<strong>有</strong>弹力——&quot;光滑&quot;只说摩擦，不说弹力。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>邪修提示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>选填受力分析：<strong>先整体</strong>（忽略内力）再看局部，很多&quot;求摩擦力&quot;题一步出答案；</li>\n<li>判断摩擦力方向：假设光滑看运动趋势，10 秒定位；</li>\n<li>风险：一句话陷阱&quot;物体静止在斜面上&quot; ⟹ 摩擦力<strong>沿斜面向上</strong>（大小 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>），与&quot;沿斜面向下&quot;猜反是经典失误。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["受力分析","弹力","摩擦力","整体法","隔离法"],"summary":"受力分析 画力五步口诀 先重力，再接触（弹力→摩擦力），最后其他力（推力/电场/磁场）。 口诀：&quot; 重力一定画，弹力看接触，摩擦看相对，其他逐条数 。&quot; 重力 ：作用在重心，方向竖直向下（一切物体都要画）； 弹力 ：找接","fit":[],"updated":"Fri Feb 14 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"mechanics","title":"力学"},{"slug":"forces","title":"受力与平衡"},{"slug":"force-analysis","title":"受力分析"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"clothesline","title":"晾衣架模型（绳越平拉力越大）","type":"example"},{"slug":"dynamic-balance","title":"动态平衡","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"equilibrium","title":"共点力平衡","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"right-triangle-balance","title":"直角三力平衡（tanθ 心算）","type":"example"},{"slug":"whole-isolate","title":"整体法求静摩擦力（秒杀）","type":"example"}]}